      "reason": "The publication key prefix moved topology-publication-v1 -> v2 -> v3 -> v4 (d32b3be, ac3b84b, 5349ef3) before this plan was committed, so the v1 anchor no longer existed. Same mutant on the current prefix: a random part makes the publication key nondeterministic, so child-first and replayed reductions disagree (red asserts equal PublicationKey)."
