      "reason": "fe8c014 put a comment block between `var batch = manifest.Batch;` and `if (batch.Edges.Count != 0)`, so the two-line anchor no longer matched. The unique first line is the same insertion point: the crash checkpoint fires before any observed row is written, so the red test sees 0 instead of 1 physical edge."
